      <p class="hint">Object shortcuts apply in the canvas, layers, and object properties. Use Ctrl in place of ⌘ on Windows and Linux. Text fields, menus, and prototypes keep their own keyboard controls. Unlock objects before deleting.</p><div class="shortcuts-list">{#each [['⌘K', 'Search'], ['⌘S', 'Save document'], ['⇧⌘\\', 'Toggle focus view'], ['⌘Z / ⇧⌘Z / Ctrl+Y', 'Undo / Redo'], ['⌘D', 'Duplicate objects or selected slides'], ['⌘C / ⌘X / ⌘V', 'Copy / Cut / Paste objects or slides'], ['⇧⌘V', 'Paste objects in place'], ['⌘A', 'Select all objects or slides in the focused panel'], ['⌘G / ⇧⌘G', 'Group / Ungroup objects'], ['Shift + A', 'Add auto layout on canvas'], ['T / R', 'Insert text / Rectangle on canvas'], ['↑ ↓ ← →', 'Nudge selected objects on canvas'], ['Shift + Arrow key', 'Move 10 px at a time on canvas'], ['Space / Enter', 'Select a focused object'], ['Shift + Space', 'Add or remove a focused object'], ['Shift + F10', 'Open context menu'], ['Enter / F2', 'Edit selected text on canvas'], ['F2', 'Rename a focused layer'], ['↑ ↓ / Home / End', 'Navigate slides or layers'], ['⌘Enter / Esc', 'Finish / Cancel text editing'], ['⌘B / ⌘I / ⌘U', 'Bold / Italic / Underline'], ['← → / Home / End', 'Move between toolbar buttons'], ['Shift + Click', 'Select multiple objects'], ['Shift + Drag', 'Constrain movement or reverse the aspect ratio lock'], ['Alt + Drag', 'Temporarily disable snapping'], ['Delete / Backspace', 'Delete selected objects or slides in the focused panel'], ['→ / ← / Space', 'Navigate slides while presenting'], ['R / P', 'Replay / Pause motion'], ['B / F', 'Black screen / Full screen'], ['Esc', 'Close panel or exit presentation']] as [keys, label]}<div><span>{label}</span><kbd>{keys}</kbd></div>{/each}</div>
